\title{ezrlearning: Learn the 'ezr' Family with a Book and Practice Exercises}
\description{
A teaching companion for the 'ezr' family of survey and modelling packages, built from hands-on workshop material. Generates practice and revision exercises -- multiple choice and "write the 'ezr' code" tasks -- that are reproducible from a seed yet randomised across draws, grades a learner's answer by running real 'ezrsurvey' and 'ezrmodel' code, assembles quizzes and exports them as self-contained worksheets, and can draft fresh exercises from a language model. Each exercise links to a chapter of the accompanying book so reading and practice stay in step.
